{
 "endpoint": "/embeddings",
 "body": {
  "model": "openai/text-embedding-3-small",
  "input": "What did reporting depend on before it switched to the event-bus?\n[2025-09-15] standup/dune/2025-09-15: We decided that reporting will read from the event-bus instead of querying the ledger directly. The reason: the nightly ledger scans were blocking billing runs. That removes the dependency on Ledger from reporting. [2025-01-17] standup/boreal/2025-01-17: The notification service depends on the bus for delivery events. If the event bus is down, the webhook dispatcher is down: it relies on it for outbound events. [2025-03-31] standup/boreal/2025-03-31: The event bus remains a Boreal service.",
  "dimensions": 1536
 },
